DESCRIPTION:This annual community event features live music\, local beer and wine\, food trucks\, and a KidsZone with crafts & games.\nThere is no charge for admission or parking\, we hope to see you there! \n**Event proceeds benefit NCWF Lake Norman Wildlife Chapter ** \nREGISTER HERE
