SUMMARY:Longleaf Management Landowner Field Workshop (Hoffman)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF and NC Wildlife Resources Commision for a field day in Richmond County! This is a great opportunity for participants to connect with like-minded landowners and professionals to learn about habitat enhancement as we discuss the benefits of prescribed fire\, native plants\, and beneficial insects in your landacape. We will walk through various sites to discuss burning in wetlands\, invasive species management\, and pine thinning to encourage herbaceous groundcover. We will also have equipment onsite to demonstrate tools that will be useful for successful management. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/longleaf-workshop/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
