SUMMARY:Stewarding our Native Land Snails (Charlotte)
DESCRIPTION:When was the last time you marveled at a snail? Like all parts of nature\, snails are just as impacted by our stewarding actions as the bugs and the birds. Denise Furr and Emily Phifer are Adjunct Curators for the Schiele Museum of Natural History\, and have been studying land snails in the Carolinas for decades. Join us for a discussion about native and invasive snail species\, how those small creatures impact our landscape\, and how best to manage your garden and yard for the good snails. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/land-snails/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/1788204693497.jpg
END:VEVENT
