SUMMARY:Dissstinctive Patternsss (Columbia)
DESCRIPTION:Curious about what snakes you’ve seen around your property and out in the community? This workshop is just for you! Join NCWF\, Pocosin Lakes National Wildlife Refuge\, and Pocosin Arts School of Fine Craft as we explore the different patterns and other identifying features of commonly observed snakes. We’ll venture out to the boardwalk to put our identification skills to the test before participants will get to paint their own snake patterns on wooden snakes to take home. \nRegistration is required for this free\, family-friendly event! Reserve your spot at https://pocosinarts.org/event/dissstinctive-patternsss/.
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/dissstinctive-patternsss-columbia/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
