DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF and Davis Community Center for a family-friendly creek clean-up at Maides Park! Protect the Smith creek and Cape Fear river from upstream pollution. All ages are welcome; children under 15 must be accompanied by an adult. All tools provided! \nREGISTER HERE
