SUMMARY:Mulch Day (Waxhaw)
DESCRIPTION:Help NCWF Habitat Builders chapter with a mulch day to get Marvin Efird Park ready for Marvin’s upcoming Arbor Day Celebration on 10/24/26. We will add mulch around existing trees and new planting areas\, remove invasive plants\, pull weeds\, and tackle general clean-up. \nREGISTER HERE
