SUMMARY:Tree ID Walk (Durham)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Durham Wildlife Stewards Chapter for a tree id walk in Sandy Creek Park! Dr. Nicolette Cage will lead us on a walk around the park where we’ll stop at certain trees\, learn about their ecological and social connections\, and find out how to identify them based on their most obvious characteristics. Come for a “treemendous” time! \nREGISTER HERE
