SUMMARY:Marvin's Annual Arbor Day Planting (Waxhaw)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Habitat Builders Chapter\, the Village of Marvin\, and TreesUnion for a fun\, hands-on day in the park! \nWe’ll be planting trees\, mulching\, and clearing out invasive species. Never planted a tree before? No worries! We’ll hold a quick demonstration to show you just how easy it is. Stick around after the workday to trade plants with fellow gardeners! \nGetting involved is a fantastic way to support the Mayor’s Monarch Pledge. We can’t wait to see you there! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/marvins-annual-arbor-day-planting-waxhaw/
